      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-21",
      "text": "The testifier suggested not sending the letter at all.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "XD60_Qatcxw",
        "ts": "0:53:17",
        "endTs": "0:53:47",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:07.486Z"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-21",
      "text": "A testifier said 87% of the people displaced by the fire were renters.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "XD60_Qatcxw",
        "ts": "0:52:27",
        "endTs": "0:52:57",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:07.486Z"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-21",
      "text": "A testifier urged the board to prioritize water for housing for displaced fire survivors.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "XD60_Qatcxw",
        "ts": "0:52:14",
        "endTs": "0:52:44",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:07.486Z"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-21",
      "text": "A testifier said asking for a moratorium on new construction would be inappropriate.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "XD60_Qatcxw",
        "ts": "0:52:02",
        "endTs": "0:52:32",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:07.486Z"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-21",
      "text": "He said his position is not opposition to development or construction.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "XD60_Qatcxw",
        "ts": "0:44:35",
        "endTs": "0:45:05",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:07.486Z"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
